@host = http://localhost:8080

### Weather question answered via the currentWeather tool
POST {{host}}/weather
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the weather in Lviv, Ukraine? When are sunrise and sunset?"
}

### Same, plus the tool calls the loop made (LangChain4j-only)
POST {{host}}/weather/tool-calls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Compare the current weather in Lviv, Ukraine and Kyiv, Ukraine."
}
